OL,3,GNEWSAGive seal pups 'space', Wildlife
OL,4,ATrust warns
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople visiting the Isle of Man
OL,7,Fcoastline have been warned not to
OL,8,Fdisturb grey seals during pupping
OL,9,Fseason, which runs from late August
OL,10,Funtil mid-November.
OL,12,FThe conservation charity Manx Wildlife
OL,13,FTrust said it was important visitors
OL,14,Fgave the pups the "space and peace"
OL,15,Fthey needed to prevent their frightened
OL,16,Fmothers from abandoning them.
OL,18,FThe charity has advised dog walkers to
OL,19,Fmake sure their pets are kept on a lead
OL,20,Fand away from the seals and their pups.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
FL,448,445,260,140,0,100
